        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nleft to right direction\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\n\n&#39; Pengaturan warna dan gaya garis agar mirip dengan gambar\nskinparam usecase {\n    BorderColor black\n    ArrowColor black\n}\nskinparam actor {\n    BorderColor black\n    BackgroundColor white\n}\n\nactor \&quot;Pengguna\\n(Siswa/Guru/Staf)\&quot; as Pengguna\nactor \&quot;Admin/Petugas\&quot; as Admin\n\nrectangle \&quot;Sistem Informasi Lost and Found\&quot; {\n    \n    &#39; Use case berwarna hijau\n    usecase \&quot;Melaporkan Barang Hilang\&quot; as UC1 #d5e8d4\n    usecase \&quot;Melaporkan Barang Ditemukan\&quot; as UC2 #d5e8d4\n    usecase \&quot;Mengisi Data Barang\&quot; as UC3 #d5e8d4\n    usecase \&quot;Mencari Barang\&quot; as UC4 #d5e8d4\n    usecase \&quot;Mengajukan Klaim Barang\&quot; as UC5 #d5e8d4\n    usecase \&quot;Melihat Detail Barang\&quot; as UC6 #d5e8d4\n    \n    &#39; Use case berwarna biru\n    usecase \&quot;Login\&quot; as UC7 #dae8fc\n    \n    &#39; Use case berwarna oranye\n    usecase \&quot;Memperbarui Status Barang\&quot; as UC8 #ffe6cc\n    usecase \&quot;Mengelola Laporan Barang\&quot; as UC9 #ffe6cc\n    usecase \&quot;Memverifikasi Klaim\&quot; as UC10 #ffe6cc\n}\n\n&#39; Relasi Aktor ke Use Case\nPengguna --&gt; UC1\nPengguna --&gt; UC2\nPengguna --&gt; UC4\nPengguna --&gt; UC5\nPengguna --&gt; UC7\n\nAdmin --&gt; UC7\nAdmin --&gt; UC9\nAdmin --&gt; UC10\n\n&#39; Relasi Include (garis putus-putus)\nUC1 ..&gt; UC3 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC2 ..&gt; UC3 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC5 ..&gt; UC6 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC9 ..&gt; UC8 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC10 ..&gt; UC8 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="Xt_tf6XojVHXapI7uJQI-28">
